    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U02-L15-ACTIVITY-005",
      "SourceSection": "15.2: The Unknown Coefficient",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Consider the polynomial function \\(f(x)=x^4 - ux^3 + 24x^2 - 32x + 16\\) where \\(u\\) is an unknown real number. If \\(x-2\\) is a factor, what is the value of \\(u\\)? Explain how you know.",
