      "Treatment": "SOURCE_SCOPED_AUTHORING_WITH_TEACHER_REVIEW",
      "TestsExecuted": "NOT_RUN"
    },
    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U02-L15-ACTIVITY-006",
      "SourceSection": "15.2: The Unknown Coefficient",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Here are some diagrams that show the same third-degree polynomial, \\(P(x) = 2x^3+5x^2+x+10\\), divided by a linear factor and by a quadratic factor.",
      "SourceLessonArtifact": "src/Edulytics.Core/Curriculum/LessonContent/RichV2/us-ccss-hs-alg2-u02-l15.rich-lesson-v2.json",
      "Treatment": "SOURCE_SCOPED_AUTHORING_WITH_TEACHER_REVIEW",
      "TestsExecuted": "NOT_RUN"
    },
    {
