      "SourceExcerpt": "\\(\\displaystyle \\require{enclose} \\begin{array}{r} x^2+12x+40 \\\\ x-5 \\enclose{longdiv}{x^3+7x^2-20x-110} \\\\ \\underline{-x^3+5x^2} \\phantom{-20x-110} \\\\ 12x^2-20x \\phantom{-110}\\\\ \\underline{-12x^2+60x} \\phantom{-110} \\\\ 40x-110 \\\\…",
